Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:14:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] MIG-12 phase 2: read the scan, skip, skip-back, clear and
 copy rows through their contracts

Add two private contract readers (one-exit and verdict-range exits), the sweep and seek
endpoint bridges, and a field-by-field renaming helper; migrate recordStep_state_run,
recordStep_scan_preserves, recordStep_clear_snapshot, recordStep_map_snapshot,
recordStep_read_prefix and recordStep_read_fields off their _run_ofCfg destructurings.

